        "proofValue": "z1oczgz3RotcBzBRDTBMee9KGMk2XY9q6XsUp9h4WT7nwAC4wuSrTEUtQB1gpUTWCD8r7qps53gynR165J7PtdWE",
        "type": "DataIntegrityProof",
        "verificationMethod": "did:key:d461e9239c6e528d6a48237b786890274ad0cb2c77cdcdd3e656844db3f4eddb"
      },
      "seq": 6,
      "text": "I would add: \"Sharing strengthens our connections because it highlights the shared essence that binds us together, even if they don't always agree on what it is.\"",
      "ts": "2026-11-26T20:47:16.776Z",
